{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>House of, bless YHWH</b> — for He separated you from the peoples. He included first 'House of Israel,' and afterward mentioned the most honored of the honored, who are: 'House of Aaron,' and then included the entire tribe, and last included all who fear YHWH, from Israel and from the nations — and this is the blessing."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 135, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:48.231150780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}